                                  Cache Key: t.queue_id                 
                                  Cache Mode: logical                   
                                  ->  Index Scan using cnq_pkey on cnq q
                                        Index Cond: (id = t.queue_id)   
                                        Filter: (NOT paused)            
  ->  Hash Join                                                         
        Hash Cond: (cnt.id = c.id)                                      
        ->  Seq Scan on cnt                                             
        ->  Hash                                                        
              ->  CTE Scan on c                                         
